{
  "info": {
    "name": "SGP API",
    "description": "Collection API du backend SGP (Système de Gestion Pénitentiaire) — Laravel.\n\nAuthentification par token Sanctum : après un login réussi, le token est automatiquement stocké dans la variable de collection `token` et réutilisé par les requêtes protégées (header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`).\n\nComptes de test seedés (`php artisan db:seed`) — mot de passe commun : `password`\n- admin / admin@sgp.local (role: admin)\n- eric.agent / agent@sgp.local (role: agent)\n- sophie.medecin / medecin@sgp.local (role: medecin)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "detenu_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (username)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"identifiant\": \"admin\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Connexion via le nom d'utilisateur. Stocke automatiquement le token reçu dans la variable de collection `token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (email)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"identifiant\": \"medecin@sgp.local\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Connexion via l'email, à la place du nom d'utilisateur. Le champ `identifiant` accepte l'un ou l'autre."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (invalid credentials)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 422', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"identifiant\": \"admin\",\n    \"password\": \"mauvais_mot_de_passe\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Cas d'erreur : identifiants invalides -> 422 avec `errors.identifiant`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Retourne l'utilisateur authentifié courant. Nécessite le token obtenu via Login."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Révoque le token courant."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Détenus",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer un détenu",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('detenu_id', body.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "numero_ecrou", "value": "2026-000123", "type": "text", "description": "Obligatoire, unique. Saisi librement par l'agent." },
                { "key": "nom", "value": "Mballa Jean", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "sexe", "value": "Masculin", "type": "text", "description": "Masculin ou Féminin" },
                { "key": "date_naissance", "value": "1990-05-14", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "lieu_naissance", "value": "Yaoundé", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nationalite", "value": "Cameroun", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "profession", "value": "Menuisier", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nom_pere", "value": "Mballa Pierre", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nom_mere", "value": "Ateba Marie", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "numero_cni", "value": "100200300", "type": "text", "description": "Optionnel, mais unique s'il est renseigné (détection de réincarcération)" },
                { "key": "numero_passeport", "value": "", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "contact_urgence_nom", "value": "Ateba Paul", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "contact_urgence_lien_parente", "value": "Frère", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "contact_urgence_telephone", "value": "699999999", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "photo_face", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "photo_profil", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/detenus",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["detenus"]
            },
            "description": "Crée une nouvelle fiche détenu. Protégé (nécessite le token). Les photos sont envoyées directement à Cloudinary ; la réponse contient les URLs publiques. Les champs numero_ecrou, numero_cni et numero_passeport doivent être uniques."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Créer un détenu (écrou en doublon)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 422', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "numero_ecrou", "value": "2026-000123", "type": "text", "description": "Rejouez ce test après avoir créé une première fois ce même numéro." },
                { "key": "nom", "value": "Autre Personne", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "sexe", "value": "Masculin", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "date_naissance", "value": "1995-01-01", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "lieu_naissance", "value": "Douala", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "profession", "value": "Chauffeur", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nom_pere", "value": "X", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nom_mere", "value": "Y", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/detenus",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["detenus"]
            },
            "description": "Cas d'erreur : numéro d'écrou déjà utilisé -> 422 avec message explicite."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Lister les détenus (paginé)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('10 par page maximum', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.length).to.be.at.most(10);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.meta.per_page).to.eql(10);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/detenus?page=1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["detenus"],
              "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "description": "Liste paginée (10 détenus par page), vue résumée (sans les données sensibles complètes). `meta.total`, `meta.last_page` etc. permettent de construire la pagination côté frontend. Changez `page` pour naviguer."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Détails d'un détenu",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/detenus/{{detenu_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["detenus", "{{detenu_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retourne tous les détails d'un détenu (fiche complète), y compris qui l'a créé/modifié. Utilise automatiquement l'id du dernier détenu créé dans cette collection."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modifier un détenu",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "_method", "value": "PUT", "type": "text", "description": "Obligatoire pour l'upload de fichiers : PHP ne lit pas le multipart en PUT direct. On POST avec ce champ, Laravel route vers la mise à jour." },
                { "key": "numero_ecrou", "value": "2026-000123", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nom", "value": "Mballa Jean-Pierre", "type": "text", "description": "Exemple de champ modifié" },
                { "key": "sexe", "value": "Masculin", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "date_naissance", "value": "1990-05-14", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "lieu_naissance", "value": "Yaoundé", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nationalite", "value": "Cameroun", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "profession", "value": "Menuisier", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nom_pere", "value": "Mballa Pierre", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "nom_mere", "value": "Ateba Marie", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "numero_cni", "value": "100200300", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "contact_urgence_nom", "value": "Ateba Paul", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "contact_urgence_lien_parente", "value": "Frère", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "contact_urgence_telephone", "value": "699999999", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "photo_face", "type": "file", "src": [], "description": "Optionnel : ne fournir que si vous voulez remplacer la photo (l'ancienne est supprimée de Cloudinary)" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/detenus/{{detenu_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["detenus", "{{detenu_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Met à jour la fiche complète d'un détenu (tous les champs obligatoires doivent être renvoyés, comme un nouveau formulaire soumis). numero_ecrou/numero_cni/numero_passeport restent uniques mais ignorent le détenu courant."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Supprimer (désactiver) un détenu",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('est_present passe à false', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.est_present).to.eql(false);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/detenus/{{detenu_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["detenus", "{{detenu_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Ne supprime jamais la ligne en base : passe est_present à false (le détenu n'est plus physiquement présent, quelle que soit la raison). L'historique détaillé des sorties viendra dans une table séparée."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
